@startuml ai-assistant-high-level-architecture
title AI Assistant — Main Components

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #F5F5F5
  BorderColor #999999
}

actor User

[Chat UI] as UI
[Assistant\n(rules + orchestration)] as Backend
[LLM] as LLM
[MCP Tools] as MCP
[Widget Renderer] as Widget

User --> UI
UI --> Backend
Backend --> LLM : prompt
Backend --> MCP : tool calls
Backend --> Widget : render result
UI --> Widget

note bottom of UI     : enterprise: CDN + SSO
note bottom of Backend : enterprise: containerized + secrets vault
note bottom of LLM     : enterprise: LLM gateway (multi-vendor, fallback)
note bottom of MCP     : enterprise: MCP gateway (policy, mTLS)
note bottom of Widget  : enterprise: managed sandbox/CSP policy

@enduml
